  "source": "display-garden-4.html",
  "heading": "Welcome to our Display Garden",
  "intro": [
    "Inspiration Grows Here",
    "Step into the heart of Columbia Nursery and discover our beautiful Display Garden—a living showcase of trees, shrubs, and perennials that thrive in the unique climate of Northwest Montana. Designed to inspire both the weekend gardener and the professional landscaper, this thoughtfully curated space highlights plants that bring color, texture, and year-round beauty to any outdoor setting.",
    "Whether you’re dreaming up a new landscape or looking to enhance an existing one, our garden offers real-life examples of how to combine hardy, regionally appropriate plants into stunning arrangements. See how foliage and bloom can work together across the seasons, explore plant pairings for sun and shade, and gather ideas to bring your own outdoor space to life.",
    "Visit often—our garden is ever-changing and always growing."
  ],
